Post-quantum support for TPM 2.0 Library Specification Version 1.85:
ML-KEM (FIPS 203) and ML-DSA (FIPS 204) keys, the TPM2_Encapsulate,
TPM2_Decapsulate, TPM2_SignDigest, TPM2_VerifyDigestSignature and
sign/verify sequence commands, ML-KEM salted sessions, and PQC
endorsement-key provisioning in swtpm_setup. Added to libtpms v0.10.2
and swtpm v0.10.1 by PQC Today, LLC. The upstream releases have no
ML-KEM or ML-DSA support.

